MZ77 NEWS                                          -*- outline -*-

* Noteworthy changes in release 0.1 (2026-10-12) [stable]

** Bug fixes

  The compressor no longer hangs on long, repetitive input, and no longer
  emits back-references that decompress to the wrong bytes.

  The decompressor rejects archives that refer before the start of the
  output and reports read and write errors instead of ignoring them.

  The window no longer closes itself after a batch finishes.  Adding files
  several times queues all of them, and failed files are reported.

** New features

  mz77 now accepts --help and --version.

** Build changes

  ./bootstrap regenerates the build system from a fresh checkout using
  gnulib-tool and autoreconf.

  'make check' runs round-trip tests for the codec.

